{"id":"dado","lemma":"dado","pos":"noun","rank":390,"glosses":["a die or dice","socket of a wrench"],"ipa":"/ˈdado/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"dados"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-dado.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Quién te ha dado eso?","en":"Who gave you that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448148"},{"text":"Corta la manzana en dados.","en":"Dice the apple.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567398"},{"text":"¿Te ha dado algo Tom?","en":"Did Tom give you something?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/194357"},{"text":"Craps es un juego de azar jugado con dados.","en":"Craps is a game of chance played with dice."},{"text":"Tom me ha dado un bolígrafo.","en":"Tom gave me a pen.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/40051"}]}